<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-090-C habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.426968" lon="-120.902389"><name>SC26-090-C</name><cmt>SC26-090</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 3.7 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 50/100; not catch probability. Center 50 ft; nearby 46–59 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-070</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.42922473495043" lon="-120.90513857202444"/><trkpt lat="35.4285997134041" lon="-120.90548518506421"/><trkpt lat="35.428321748491214" lon="-120.90505182557686"/><trkpt lat="35.42750886949717" lon="-120.9049627460682"/><trkpt lat="35.42741302916682" lon="-120.90463481328176"/><trkpt lat="35.427048776600024" lon="-120.90442397543644"/><trkpt lat="35.42694911161504" lon="-120.90387586840203"/><trkpt lat="35.42613432021053" lon="-120.9036767142953"/><trkpt lat="35.42612667189361" lon="-120.90323636530944"/><trkpt lat="35.426393169610876" lon="-120.90300918121717"/><trkpt lat="35.42638743166178" lon="-120.90267891854685"/><trkpt lat="35.42593498146853" lon="-120.90258051617708"/><trkpt lat="35.426011696358245" lon="-120.90180757013128"/><trkpt lat="35.42555159022766" lon="-120.90126882772408"/><trkpt lat="35.425542018741